  "readme": "<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/RAAJK20Pro/NetworkEnhancer/main/EnhancerSource/GitHub/banner.png\" width=\"100%\" />\n</p>\n\n<h1 align=\"center\">KernelEnhancer</h1>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <sub>Advanced Kernel Tuning for Stable Performance</sub>\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/RAAJK20Pro/KernelEnhancer/releases\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/v/release/RAAJK20Pro/KernelEnhancer?style=for-the-badge&label=Latest&color=0f172a\"></a><a href=\"https://github.com/RAAJK20Pro/KernelEnhancer/stargazers\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/stars/RAAJK20Pro/KernelEnhancer?style=for-the-badge&color=0f172a\"></a><a href=\"https://github.com/RAAJK20Pro/KernelEnhancer/releases\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/downloads/RAAJK20Pro/KernelEnhancer/total?style=for-the-badge&color=0f172a\"></a>\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  KernelEnhancer applies targeted kernel tuning to reduce stutter and improve consistency, delivering smoother UI and more stable performance in daily use and gaming.\n</p>\n\n---\n\n## Key Features\n\n`Smooth Performance` — Reduces stutter and improves responsiveness  \n\n`Better Consistency` — Stable performance during gaming  \n\n`Efficient Usage` — Balanced battery and background activity  \n\n`Memory Tuning` — Improved multitasking and app retention  \n\n---\n\n## Installation\n\n1. Download the latest `.zip` from [Releases](https://github.com/RAAJK20Pro/KernelEnhancer/releases)  \n2. Open Magisk or KernelSU  \n3. Go to Modules → Install from Storage  \n4. Select the zip file and reboot\n\n---\n\n## FAQ\n\n**Q: Works on MediaTek / Snapdragon / Exynos?**  \nA: Yes, uses standard kernel interfaces; results may vary.  \n\n---\n\n**Q: Use with other performance modules?**  \nA: Not recommended—may conflict.\n",
  "readmeHTML": "<p><p align=\"center\"></p>\n<p>  <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/RAAJK20Pro/NetworkEnhancer/main/EnhancerSource/GitHub/banner.png\" width=\"100%\" /></p>\n<p></p></p>\n\n<p><h1 align=\"center\">KernelEnhancer</h1></p>\n\n<p><p align=\"center\"></p>\n<p>  <sub>Advanced Kernel Tuning for Stable Performance</sub></p>\n<p></p></p>\n\n<p><p align=\"center\"></p>\n<p>  <a href=\"https://github.com/RAAJK20Pro/KernelEnhancer/releases\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/v/release/RAAJK20Pro/KernelEnhancer?style=for-the-badge&label=Latest&color=0f172a\"></a><a href=\"https://github.com/RAAJK20Pro/KernelEnhancer/stargazers\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/stars/RAAJK20Pro/KernelEnhancer?style=for-the-badge&color=0f172a\"></a><a href=\"https://github.com/RAAJK20Pro/KernelEnhancer/releases\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/downloads/RAAJK20Pro/KernelEnhancer/total?style=for-the-badge&color=0f172a\"></a></p>\n<p></p></p>\n\n<p><p align=\"center\"></p>\n<p>  KernelEnhancer applies targeted kernel tuning to reduce stutter and improve consistency, delivering smoother UI and more stable performance in daily use and gaming.</p>\n<p></p></p>\n\n<p>---</p>\n\n<h2>Key Features</h2>\n\n<p><code>Smooth Performance</code> — Reduces stutter and improves responsiveness</p>\n\n<p><code>Better Consistency</code> — Stable performance during gaming</p>\n\n<p><code>Efficient Usage</code> — Balanced battery and background activity</p>\n\n<p><code>Memory Tuning</code> — Improved multitasking and app retention</p>\n\n<p>---</p>\n\n<h2>Installation</h2>\n\n<li>Download the latest `.zip` from [Releases](https://github.com/RAAJK20Pro/KernelEnhancer/releases)</li>\n<li>Open Magisk or KernelSU</li>\n<li>Go to Modules → Install from Storage</li>\n<li>Select the zip file and reboot</li>\n\n<p>---</p>\n\n<h2>FAQ</h2>\n\n<p><b>Q: Works on MediaTek / Snapdragon / Exynos?</b></p>\n<p>A: Yes, uses standard kernel interfaces; results may vary.</p>\n\n<p>---</p>\n\n<p><b>Q: Use with other performance modules?</b></p>\n<p>A: Not recommended—may conflict.</p>",
